{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aPhil and Leonardo\u300bis a 2D platformer where you\u2019ll control two characters simultaneously: Phil, a blind elderly man, and Leonardo, a little pig. But Leonardo isn\u2019t your average piglet\u2014as a native of this otherworld, he possesses unique abilities. One moment he acts as a vehicle, carrying Phil across distances; the next, he transforms into a shield, blocking attacks to keep Phil safe from harm. Meanwhile, though Phil can\u2019t see, he plays an irreplaceable role in the game too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath this seemingly cute, fairy-tale world lies a story full of twists and turns, and the truth of this realm is far more complex than it first appears. This world\u2026 isn\u2019t a fairy tale.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3935220?t=1758736299","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3935220?t=1758736299","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935220/99189924837428c948dec3d5944a3fb1ba1224db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758736299","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935220/99189924837428c948dec3d5944a3fb1ba1224db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758736299","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aPhil and Leonardo\u300bis a 2D platformer where you\u2019ll control two characters simultaneously: Phil, a blind elderly man, and Leonardo, a little pig. But Leonardo isn\u2019t your average piglet\u2014as a native of this otherworld, he possesses unique abilities. One moment he acts as a vehicle, carrying Phil across distances; the next, he transforms into a shield, blocking attacks to keep Phil safe from harm. Meanwhile, though Phil can\u2019t see, he plays an i